<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "middle">
<ptxt>
Fail-safe operation is canceled when all of the following conditions are met.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Millimeter wave radar recovers good visibility.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Internal temperature of RBS control module returns to normal.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Power supply voltage to RBS control module returns to normal.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> control module cancels temporary stop.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
